      "content": "thanks for this. it's a decent start but i think it's a bit too brief for a proper lit review section. my supervisor is really strict about \"comprehensiveness\" and the citation coverage score is actually pretty low right now since you only mentioned a handful of people. \n\ncan you expand this out? i need more depth on the specific trends—like the tension between structural and relational views, or how it applies to different social contexts. please try to weave in more of those researchers from the list as you go so the coverage score goes up, but keep it scholarly. i don't want it to look forced, just really thorough.",
